{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07888","headline":"岘山送张去非游巴东 · 孟浩然","name":"岘山送张去非游巴东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岘山南郭外，送别每登临。\n沙岸江村近，松门山寺深。\n一言予有赠，三峡尔将寻。\n祖席宜城酒，征途云梦林。\n蹉跎游子意，眷恋故人心。\n去矣勿淹滞，巴东猿夜吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}